      "exact_correction": "Implement T022 contextual WorkflowDefinitionError diagnostics and valid-control/one-mutation regressions for the three retained cases, preserving ValueError compatibility and carrier/assignment guards; then implement dependent T023 inventory JSON projection and regression assertions. Run the declared fresh analysis and eligibility steps before source effects. Preserve the original T005 completion and evidence.",
